   "stem": {
      "text": "The function q is given by q(x) = 3 - x^2 for x < 1, q(x) = ax + b for 1 <= x <= 4, and q(x) = sqrt(x) + 5 for x > 4, where a and b are constants. If q is continuous for all real x, what is the value of a?"
